# Line-ending policy for this repository. This file states what each
# directive does; the rationale is recorded in
# docs/security/DECISION_LOG.md row 96.8.1.
#
# `* text=auto` normalises every text file to LF in the committed blob and
# lets a checkout follow the platform convention, so a Windows working tree
# with core.autocrlf=true may hold CRLF while the blob stays LF.
#
# `*.sh text eol=lf` additionally checks shell scripts out with LF on every
# platform. Four of them are executed by a POSIX shell:
# scripts/deploy.sh and scripts/render_kubernetes_manifests.sh by the
# release path, .github/scripts/check_secret_policy.sh by the `backend` job
# of .github/workflows/ci.yml, and scripts/setup_dev_environment.sh by
# backend/tests/security/test_deployment_contract.py.
#
# Adding this file changes no committed blob: no tracked blob in this
# repository carries a carriage return.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
